Subject: [PATCH 09/16] =?UTF-8?q?Cabeceras=20de=20cach=C3=A9=20en=20Vercel?=
 =?UTF-8?q?:=20los=20cambios=20se=20ven=20sin=20navegaci=C3=B3n=20privada?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

El navegador servía el index.html viejo cacheado, así que solo se veían los
cambios en incógnito. Ahora index.html (y las rutas SPA) van con "no-cache"
(se revalidan siempre) y los assets con hash quedan inmutables un año.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FSPnmgNrD2aeSYTbzoruWy
---
 vercel.json | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vercel.json b/vercel.json
index 0d199b2..5a1e561 100644
--- a/vercel.json
+++ b/vercel.json
@@ -1,5 +1,19 @@
 {
   "rewrites": [
     { "source": "/(.*)", "destination": "/index.html" }
+  ],
+  "headers": [
+    {
+      "source": "/assets/(.*)",
+      "headers": [
+        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable" }
+      ]
+    },
+    {
+      "source": "/((?!assets/).*)",
+      "headers": [
+        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }
+      ]
+    }
   ]
 }
-- 
